---
title: Frontend Interrupt Resume QA Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Backend SSE
  participant API as services/api.ts
  participant S as Zustand Store
  participant C as InterruptCard
  participant R as Resume Endpoint

  B->>API: data: {type: interrupt, checkpoint_id, interrupt_contexts, bash_request/detail_request}
  API->>API: mapInterruptData(raw)
  API->>S: onInterrupt(InterruptData)
  alt Chat
    S->>S: updateLastMessage(... interrupt)
  else Ops
    S->>S: updateOpsStep(... interrupt)
  end
  S->>C: render card
  C->>C: require checkpoint_id
  C->>C: require interrupt_ids from contexts
  alt approve / reject / resolved
    C->>R: {approved, resolved, interrupt_ids}
  else detail selection
    C->>R: {selection_value, interrupt_ids}
  end
  alt resumeViaOps
    R->>B: POST /ai_ops_resume_stream {checkpoint_id,...payload}
  else chat
    R->>B: POST /chat_resume_stream {id, checkpoint_id,...payload}
  end
  B-->>API: resumed SSE stream
